(1965692, 270547, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at this one for a while, and while I see the pun and the reason for reversing the words in the phrase, it seems like a bit of a stretch.  I do think the picture can stand alone enough to tell a story though which is always good.</td>', 'I''ve been looking at this one for a while, and while I see the pun and the reason for reversing the words in the phrase, it seems like a bit of a stretch.  I do think the picture can stand alone enough to tell a story though which is always good.', '2005-12-20 19:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
