(1967143, 270648, 42984, '<td valign="top">Strong pun, weak photographically.  The reflections and uncontrolled light spoil and detract</td>', 'Strong pun, weak photographically.  The reflections and uncontrolled light spoil and detract', '2005-12-21 05:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967147, 270651, 42984, '<td valign="top">Gutsy image, weak on the pun. I tied to get it - truly I did</td>', 'Gutsy image, weak on the pun. I tied to get it - truly I did', '2005-12-21 05:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967149, 268540, 42984, '<td valign="top">The pun works, the image doesn''t.  The colour and contrast have been pushed too much and are breaking up.  It5''s out of focus (an unforgivable sin:)</td>', 'The pun works, the image doesn''t.  The colour and contrast have been pushed too much and are breaking up.  It5''s out of focus (an unforgivable sin:)', '2005-12-21 05:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967152, 270604, 42984, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. Grat pun, it works photographically so well.  The image too is great in light and tone.  The contrast of the jeans to the beige works strongly.  I can see why it had to be centred, not exactly anywhere else to go is there :)</td>', 'Brilliant. Grat pun, it works photographically so well.  The image too is great in light and tone.  The contrast of the jeans to the beige works strongly.  I can see why it had to be centred, not exactly anywhere else to go is there :)', '2005-12-21 05:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967154, 270668, 42984, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I tried to get it but couldn''t</td>', 'Hmmm, I tried to get it but couldn''t', '2005-12-21 05:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967157, 269981, 42984, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty cute really.  Good pun, good photographically</td>', 'That''s pretty cute really.  Good pun, good photographically', '2005-12-21 05:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967159, 270507, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good pun perhaps not as strong photographically.  It may be the bottle that''s really one element too much.  The title would tell us that it''s salt and the bright contrast with the colour of the battery would have given you a lot of composition freedom and options</td>', 'Good pun perhaps not as strong photographically.  It may be the bottle that''s really one element too much.  The title would tell us that it''s salt and the bright contrast with the colour of the battery would have given you a lot of composition freedom and options', '2005-12-21 05:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967161, 270413, 42984, '<td valign="top">Eggs Benedit - my favourite brekkie.  But I don''t get the pun :(</td>', 'Eggs Benedit - my favourite brekkie.  But I don''t get the pun :(', '2005-12-21 05:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967163, 270128, 42984, '<td valign="top">Well shot but perhaps a little weak on the pun.  It sort of comes across as contrived rather than cute (whatever that means - LOL)</td>', 'Well shot but perhaps a little weak on the pun.  It sort of comes across as contrived rather than cute (whatever that means - LOL)', '2005-12-21 05:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967164, 270671, 42984, '<td valign="top">OMG, I have found the Blue for this challenge.  What can I say?  Perfect pun and one of the most brilliant photos I have seen in a long time.  If it was a little less centred it would have to be a 10, only makes 9 so far.</td>', 'OMG, I have found the Blue for this challenge.  What can I say?  Perfect pun and one of the most brilliant photos I have seen in a long time.  If it was a little less centred it would have to be a 10, only makes 9 so far.', '2005-12-21 05:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967165, 270622, 42984, '<td valign="top">Sorry, don''t get it.  I''d like to, I tried :)</td>', 'Sorry, don''t get it.  I''d like to, I tried :)', '2005-12-21 05:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967166, 270665, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a great pun!  Photographically a little weak.  The shallow DOF shows on the bottle and throws an important part of the image, the plug, too for out of view.  Your verticals must always be vertical and perhaps a stromngeer composition would be slightly off-centre to the right</td>', 'This is a great pun!  Photographically a little weak.  The shallow DOF shows on the bottle and throws an important part of the image, the plug, too for out of view.  Your verticals must always be vertical and perhaps a stromngeer composition would be slightly off-centre to the right', '2005-12-21 05:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967167, 270590, 42984, '<td valign="top">Lovely photographically, in fact very strong.  The pun is abi thard to get</td>', 'Lovely photographically, in fact very strong.  The pun is abi thard to get', '2005-12-21 05:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967173, 270656, 42984, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Fantastic pun and a great image.  You know, I nearly went past this because I didn''t understand the title.  When I parsed it down to "Four Loaf Cleaver" it clicked.  Top 20 image so far in this challenge</td>', 'Wow.  Fantastic pun and a great image.  You know, I nearly went past this because I didn''t understand the title.  When I parsed it down to "Four Loaf Cleaver" it clicked.  Top 20 image so far in this challenge', '2005-12-21 05:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967175, 270398, 42984, '<td valign="top">Strong pun, weaker photographically.  The composition is a little overloaded with our of focus floor</td>', 'Strong pun, weaker photographically.  The composition is a little overloaded with our of focus floor', '2005-12-21 05:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
