(1973183, 268447, 42984, '<td valign="top">So cute.  Good pun, fun models.  Your lighting has that nice dramatic look but the shadows make it really really difficult to actually see the plushies and to determine what the photo is.  You can achieve fill light with a piece of polystyrene bouncing your primary light source back into the sadows.  It woul have made the workld of difference.</td>', 'So cute.  Good pun, fun models.  Your lighting has that nice dramatic look but the shadows make it really really difficult to actually see the plushies and to determine what the photo is.  You can achieve fill light with a piece of polystyrene bouncing your primary light source back into the sadows.  It woul have made the workld of difference.', '2005-12-23 01:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1973190, 270627, 42984, '<td valign="top">I would hang this on my wall as a mural - terrific.  The colour, the composition and the dynamic impact of it is so very corporate reception area. But I have voted it quite harshly for the challenge.  The pun is a a little hard to understand and in this format, the gausian blureffect seems to spoil it as a photograph.</td>', 'I would hang this on my wall as a mural - terrific.  The colour, the composition and the dynamic impact of it is so very corporate reception area. But I have voted it quite harshly for the challenge.  The pun is a a little hard to understand and in this format, the gausian blureffect seems to spoil it as a photograph.', '2005-12-23 01:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
