(1977597, 270444, 30861, '<td valign="top">I have puzzled and puzzled at this one. I have absolutely NO clue what the pun is, and it is driving me crazy. I have to assme there IS a pun, and I''m missing it. The picture itself is spectacularly nice, just beautiful. The way the snake details echo the details of the hilt, for example... The perfect way the snake''s tail makes a "bracelet" on the wrist. I love this shot.<br/> <br/>So I''m gonna do somethign I never do, and boot you to the top of the stack on the ASSUMPTION there''s something here I''m missing. I hope that''s true :-)</td>', 'I have puzzled and puzzled at this one. I have absolutely NO clue what the pun is, and it is driving me crazy. I have to assme there IS a pun, and I''m missing it. The picture itself is spectacularly nice, just beautiful. The way the snake details echo the details of the hilt, for example... The perfect way the snake''s tail makes a "bracelet" on the wrist. I love this shot. So I''m gonna do somethign I never do, and boot you to the top of the stack on the ASSUMPTION there''s something here I''m missing. I hope that''s true :-)', '2005-12-25 23:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
