(1978071, 270413, 29904, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.  I really loved this, one of my top pics!! By far the most creative pun! and beautifully done!!  Appealing soft light without being flat, and excellent choice of cropping.  Did not have a clue the sauce was was fake  :)  yes, underrated!</td>', 'Returning for comments.  I really loved this, one of my top pics!! By far the most creative pun! and beautifully done!!  Appealing soft light without being flat, and excellent choice of cropping.  Did not have a clue the sauce was was fake  :)  yes, underrated!', '2005-12-26 02:23:22.000000', NULL, 0),
