(1978498, 270555, 28710, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m officially weird. I laughed more on this picture than any other in the challenge. It''s 120th out of 140. <br/> <br/>I''d have given a 10 in the challenge if I wasn''t so busy lately.<br/> <br/>I know you were itching to give it more, but you could have done without the sprinkles maybe? Try increasing DOF perhaps?<br/> <br/>I might also have liked a Sepia tone or a 1920''s style heavy yellow lighting?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-26 08:46:01.</i></td>', 'Ok, I''m officially weird. I laughed more on this picture than any other in the challenge. It''s 120th out of 140.  I''d have given a 10 in the challenge if I wasn''t so busy lately. I know you were itching to give it more, but you could have done without the sprinkles maybe? Try increasing DOF perhaps? I might also have liked a Sepia tone or a 1920''s style heavy yellow lighting?', '2005-12-26 08:44:55.000000', '2005-12-26 08:46:01.000000', 0),
