(1979731, 269314, 31812, '<td valign="top">I agree with the below comments. The eye doesn''t rest on any one focal point. I think if the bottles were in sharper focus, and perhaps if their positioning had be changed a little this would have popped. I like the idea, and there''s definitely a festive atmosphere evoked here. I think from an emotive standpoint, there''s good storytelling, if only just a snapshot of the season''s festivities, and the pun itself is clearly defined.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-26 20:40:01.</i></td>', 'I agree with the below comments. The eye doesn''t rest on any one focal point. I think if the bottles were in sharper focus, and perhaps if their positioning had be changed a little this would have popped. I like the idea, and there''s definitely a festive atmosphere evoked here. I think from an emotive standpoint, there''s good storytelling, if only just a snapshot of the season''s festivities, and the pun itself is clearly defined.', '2005-12-26 20:39:39.000000', '2005-12-26 20:40:01.000000', 0),
