(1993246, 270511, 19672, '<td valign="top">I am truly sorry this came out so low in rankings. It was a superbly executed foto. In the top 5 of those I rated. (Gave it a 9.)<br/> <br/>Both my mom and fiance "awwwwed" when they saw it. It garnered one of the best reactions of all the entries I showed them. Be proud. DPC does not always accept very creative shots. <br/> <br/>In fact, I bet if you made this one available as a print you''ll see more success than many ribbon fotos.</td>', 'I am truly sorry this came out so low in rankings. It was a superbly executed foto. In the top 5 of those I rated. (Gave it a 9.) Both my mom and fiance "awwwwed" when they saw it. It garnered one of the best reactions of all the entries I showed them. Be proud. DPC does not always accept very creative shots.  In fact, I bet if you made this one available as a print you''ll see more success than many ribbon fotos.', '2006-01-01 21:19:03.000000', NULL, 0),
